// Source: https://github.com/DanishMansuriIN/Enterprise-Detection-Threat-Hunting-Platform
// Collected: 2026-07-23
// KQL Library - https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4624
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Account, IpAddress, LogonType, Activity
| sort by TimeGenerated desc